{"id":"23.01.BoxParadox","contentHtml":"<p>This project is a technical research focused on the <strong>deconstruction and implementation</strong> of complex puzzle mechanics.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> adapt for mobile devices and recreate from scratch in Unity the \"nested spaces\" mechanic from the game Patrick's Parabox.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was to design an architecture for <strong>managing transitions between game worlds of different scales</strong>, correctly saving the state of each \"layer\" and ensuring smooth transitions.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Architecture:</strong> A system was developed where each block is a <strong>separate, isolated level</strong> with an independent state, allowing them to be nested within each other.</li>\n<li><strong>Control:</strong> Created a context-sensitive controller that can both push a block and \"enter\" it, moving to another level of nesting.</li>\n<li><strong>Visualization:</strong> Special attention was paid to <strong>smooth visual transitions</strong> between scales so that the complex mechanic remained intuitively understandable.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Outcome</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mechanic Implemented:</strong> The key mechanic of \"entering blocks\" and controlling objects at different scales was successfully recreated as a prototype with 9 levels.</li>\n<li><strong>Skills Demonstration:</strong> The project proved my ability to <mark>solve complex, abstract architectural tasks</mark> and implement non-standard game mechanics.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Box Paradox","date":"2023-01","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Mobile","Unity","C#","Illustrator"],"heroVideo":["ZLiu1tGQYzM"],"shortDescription":"<p>Tech demo: <mark>Recreated the recursive puzzle mechanic</mark> from Patrick's Parabox, allowing the player to \"enter\" blocks and solve puzzles at different scales.</p>\n","storeLinks":null,"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/23.01.BoxParadox/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/23.01.BoxParadox/card.video?v=1765111378439&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/23.01.BoxParadox/screenshots/1.webp","width":520,"height":724},{"src":"/images/projects/23.01.BoxParadox/screenshots/2.webp","width":520,"height":724},{"src":"/images/projects/23.01.BoxParadox/screenshots/3.webp","width":520,"height":724}]}